  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "The Hog Raiders are a squad available in the Clan Capital, available when the Hog Raider Barracks is constructed (this requires the Dragon Cliffs district to be unlocked, when the Capital Hall is upgraded to level 6). The squad spawns two Hog Riders and one Hog Glider.",
    "One of the Hog Raiders is similar to the Hog Glider in the Builder Base, in that it is a Hog Rider on a glider that attempts to crash onto the nearest defense, stunning it for 4 seconds if it succeeds. Regardless, the Hog Rider will drop down and continue to fight."
  ],
